    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relive the nostalgia of your school desk in this golf game for Steam!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Play]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategize to conquer your favorite courses with a variety of settings!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with 9 or 18 holes and compete for high scores on the online leaderboards!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Friendly Match]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with up to 4 people!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in serious showdowns with stroke play or match play!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Edit]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Freely arrange and design your own original course!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create a unique 18-hole course all your own!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Gacha]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your points to obtain new clubs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find your ultimate favorite!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Minigame]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hit the ball and aim for big points!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn points based on where the ball lands!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relive the nostalgia of your school desk in this golf game for Steam!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Play]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategize to conquer your favorite courses with a variety of settings!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with 9 or 18 holes and compete for high scores on the online leaderboards!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Friendly Match]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with up to 4 people!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in serious showdowns with stroke play or match play!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Edit]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Freely arrange and design your own original course!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create a unique 18-hole course all your own!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Gacha]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your points to obtain new clubs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find your ultimate favorite!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Minigame]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hit the ball and aim for big points!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn points based on where the ball lands!</p>",
